# Full test suite after refactors

After a **code refactor** (restructuring types, moving packages, extracting classes, or other behavior-preserving edits that touch production or shared test code), you **must** run the **full Maven test matrix** for this repository before treating the work as done. Do not substitute a single `-Dtest=…` class unless the user explicitly asks for a narrower check.

Run from the repo root, in order:

```bash
./mvnw clean test
./mvnw clean test -Psb3
./mvnw clean test -Psb4,tc
```

The last command needs **Docker** (Testcontainers). If Docker is unavailable, say so and run at least the first two; otherwise run all three.

See [TESTING.md](TESTING.md) for profile details. After `pom.xml` changes or `-Psb3` runs, still follow [.cursor/rules/jdt-workspace-sync.mdc](.cursor/rules/jdt-workspace-sync.mdc) for `jdt maven update`.
